[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/app/output/airport_chart.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Global Airport Performance: Throughput vs On-Time Rate</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f4f5f7;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-alt: #f0f2f5;
      --border: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      --text: #1a2030;
      --text-dim: #5a6580;
      --text-muted: #8a93a8;

      /* Region palette — distinct, non-AI-slop */
      --c-na:    #1d6fa4;   /* North America — steel blue */
      --c-eu:    #c2410c;   /* Europe — terracotta */
      --c-ap:    #0d7a5f;   /* Asia-Pacific — teal */
      --c-me:    #b45309;   /* Middle East — amber-brown */
      --c-la:    #7c3d12;   /* Latin America — dark rust */
      --c-af:    #6b5c0a;   /* Africa — olive-gold */

      --font-body: 'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 32px 24px 48px;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 40px 40px;
    }

    .page-header {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .chart-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 28px 28px 20px;
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }

    .chart-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .axis-labels {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .axis-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .axis-label span {
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .legend {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px 20px;
    }

    .legend-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .legend-dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .chart-wrap {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: 520px;
    }

    .bubble-size-legend {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .size-legend-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .size-bubbles {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .size-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .size-circle {
      background: rgba(80,100,130,0.2);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(80,100,130,0.45);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: block;
    }

    .size-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }

    .footnote {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 14px auto 0;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page-header">
  <div class="eyebrow">Global Airport Analysis · 30 Airports · 6 Regions</div>
  <h1>Throughput vs. On-Time Performance</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Each bubble represents one airport. Position encodes annual passengers and punctuality; bubble area encodes route network scale; color encodes region.</p>
</div>

<div class="chart-card">
  <div class="chart-meta">
    <div class="axis-labels">
      <div class="axis-label">X: <span>Annual Passengers (millions)</span></div>
      <div class="axis-label">Y: <span>On-Time Rate (%)</span></div>
      <div class="axis-label">Size: <span>Number of Routes</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-na)"></span>North America</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-eu)"></span>Europe</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-ap)"></span>Asia-Pacific</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-me)"></span>Middle East</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-la)"></span>Latin America</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--c-af)"></span>Africa</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-wrap">
    <canvas id="bubbleChart"></canvas>
  </div>

  <div class="bubble-size-legend">
    <span class="size-legend-label">Route scale →</span>
    <div class="size-bubbles">
      <div class="size-item">
        <span class="size-circle" style="width:14px;height:14px;"></span>
        <span class="size-label">~95</span>
      </div>
      <div class="size-item">
        <span class="size-circle" style="width:22px;height:22px;"></span>
        <span class="size-label">~150</span>
      </div>
      <div class="size-item">
        <span class="size-circle" style="width:32px;height:32px;"></span>
        <span class="size-label">~230</span>
      </div>
      <div class="size-item">
        <span class="size-circle" style="width:44px;height:44px;"></span>
        <span class="size-label">~310</span>
      </div>
      <div class="size-item">
        <span class="size-circle" style="width:54px;height:54px;"></span>
        <span class="size-label">~370</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="size-label" style="color:#8a93a8;margin-left:6px">= number of routes</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="footnote">
  Sources: Airport operational data · Throughput figures are approximate annual totals; on-time rate is a blended departure/arrival punctuality metric; route counts reflect peak-season snapshots.
  <br>Annotated airports: <strong>Atlanta (ATL)</strong> — highest throughput globally &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Dubai (DXB)</strong> — largest Middle East hub &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Tokyo Haneda (HND)</strong> — highest on-time rate among the 30 airports surveyed.
</div>

